              "content": "Journey Event Posting API accepts events that describe what occurred, when, and by whom on every interaction across touch points and applications. Data Ingestion is based on Cloud Events specification for describing event data in a common way. API accepts data in the form of POST with support for Header based authorization. \n\nRole and Scope: Requires id full admin role with cjds:admin_org_write or any role with cjp:config_write scope.",
